['malaysia-ayam-percik','Ayam Percik (Kelantan Grilled Chicken with Coconut Gravy)','Malaysia','🇲🇾',50,['chicken thigh','coconut milk','chili paste','lemongrass','shallot','tamarind paste','sugar'],[[200,'g'],[140,'ml'],[2,'tsp'],[12,'g'],[35,'g'],[1,'tsp'],[1,'tsp']],'https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/18-unique-dishes-you-must-try-in-kelantan',['Simmer coconut milk with chili, lemongrass, shallot, tamarind, and sugar to a coating gravy.','Brush the chicken with a little gravy and place it on a medium-hot grill.','Turn and baste repeatedly so the sauce caramelizes without scorching.','Cook until the center is safe, then spoon over the remaining hot gravy.']],
['malaysia-cendol','Cendol (Malaysian Shaved Ice with Pandan Jelly)','Malaysia','🇲🇾',20,['shaved ice','coconut milk','palm sugar','rice flour jelly','pandan extract'],[[180,'g'],[100,'ml'],[25,'g'],[70,'g'],[0.5,'tsp']],'https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/malaysian-food-52-top-picks-you-shouldn-t-miss',['Dissolve the palm sugar with a spoonful of water and cool the syrup.','Mix the green rice-flour jelly strands with pandan extract if they need refreshing.','Pile shaved ice in a chilled bowl and scatter the jelly over it.','Pour over coconut milk and palm-sugar syrup and serve immediately.']],
['malaysia-pulut-panggang','Pulut Panggang (Malaysian Grilled Glutinous Rice Parcel)','Malaysia','🇲🇾',50,['glutinous rice','coconut milk','dried shrimp','grated coconut','shallot','chili','banana leaf'],[[100,'g'],[100,'ml'],[20,'g'],[35,'g'],[25,'g'],[5,'g'],[1,'piece']],'https://www.malaysia.travel/explore/malaysian-food-52-top-picks-you-shouldn-t-miss',['Steam the soaked glutinous rice with coconut milk until tender but not mushy.','Fry chopped shrimp, coconut, shallot, and chili until dry and aromatic.','Soften the banana leaf, spread on rice and filling, then roll it into a tight parcel.','Grill while turning until the leaf is lightly charred and the parcel is hot throughout.']]
